Dataset (not redistributed in this repository)
------------------------------------------------
HDFS_v1 log dataset, distributed by Loghub (https://github.com/logpai/loghub).
Originally collected by Xu et al., "Detecting Large-Scale System Problems by Mining
Console Logs", SOSP 2009. Loghub datasets are provided for research purposes.
scripts/download_data.py fetches it from the source; users must follow Loghub's terms
and cite Loghub and Xu et al. when publishing results.

Derived artefacts
-----------------
The generated tables and figures in reports/ and the release bundle (trained models,
score distributions, demo samples) are derived from HDFS_v1. Use them for research and
education under the dataset's terms.

